    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Gripping Duel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against your friends or others online in a simple game that facilitates perfectly synced 1v1 pistol duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518350/extras/fe88bb00526d5fca4d9aae070ac0f53b.poster.avif?t=1751131579\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518350/extras/fe88bb00526d5fca4d9aae070ac0f53b.webm?t=1751131579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518350/extras/fe88bb00526d5fca4d9aae070ac0f53b.mp4?t=1751131579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three...Two...One...Shoot!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand directly opposite of your opponent, then after a brief\u00a0nerve-racking moment, quickly turn to out-flick your opponent and win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518350/extras/d8143a64c970587582dad96751ad1ae2.poster.avif?t=1751131579\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518350/extras/d8143a64c970587582dad96751ad1ae2.webm?t=1751131579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518350/extras/d8143a64c970587582dad96751ad1ae2.mp4?t=1751131579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in beautifully crafted environments\u00a0as you face certain death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518350/extras/d8c17e035ea2f8ce35575d8ddf61f3c0.poster.avif?t=1751131579\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518350/extras/d8c17e035ea2f8ce35575d8ddf61f3c0.webm?t=1751131579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518350/extras/d8c17e035ea2f8ce35575d8ddf61f3c0.mp4?t=1751131579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lets Dance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on several duels to improve your profile, your marksmanship, and have fun!</p>",
