_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518350/extras/d8c17e035ea2f8ce35575d8ddf61f3c0.poster.avif?t=1751131579\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518350/extras/d8c17e035ea2f8ce35575d8ddf61f3c0.webm?t=1751131579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518350/extras/d8c17e035ea2f8ce35575d8ddf61f3c0.mp4?t=1751131579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lets Dance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on several duels to improve your profile, your marksmanship, and have fun!</p>",
